(2655, 372, '_siteseo_analysis_data', 'a:5:{s:10:"good_count";i:6;s:13:"warning_count";i:5;s:11:"error_count";i:4;s:6:"checks";a:16:{i:0;a:4:{s:5:"label";s:13:"Canonical URL";s:6:"status";s:4:"Good";s:12:"status_class";s:4:"good";s:7:"details";s:362:"<p>A canonical URL is required by search engines to handle duplicate content.</p><p>We found 1 canonical URL in your source code. Below, the list:</p><ul><li><span class="dashicons dashicons-arrow-right"></span><a href="https://davidkausek.com/about/" target="_blank">https://davidkausek.com/about/</a><span class="dashicons dashicons-external"></span></li></ul>";}i:1;a:4:{s:5:"label";s:10:"Word Count";s:6:"status";s:4:"Good";s:12:"status_class";s:4:"good";s:7:"details";s:451:"<p>Word count isn''t a direct ranking factor, but it''s important for your content to be high-quality, relevant, and unique. To meet these criteria, your article should include a sufficient number of paragraphs to ensure adequate word count.</p><ul><li>442 words found</li><li>221 unique words found</li></ul><li><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-up"></span>Your content contains over 300 words, which meets the minimum requirement for a post</li>";}i:2;a:4:{s:5:"label";s:15:"Keyword Density";s:6:"status";s:5:"Error";s:12:"status_class";s:5:"error";s:7:"details";s:150:"<p>We couldn''t calculate the keyword density. This may be because you haven''t added any content or your target keywords are missing from the post.</p>";}i:3;a:4:{s:5:"label";s:10:"Meta Title";s:6:"status";s:4:"Good";s:12:"status_class";s:4:"good";s:7:"details";s:98:"<p><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-up"></span>The length of your title is appropriate.</p>";}i:4;a:4:{s:5:"label";s:16:"Meta Description";s:6:"status";s:7:"Warning";s:12:"status_class";s:7:"warning";s:7:"details";s:199:"<p><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-down"></span>A custom meta description has not been set for this post. If the global meta description works for you, you can ignore this recommendation.</p>";}i:5;a:4:{s:5:"label";s:27:"Alternative texts of images";s:6:"status";s:5:"Error";s:12:"status_class";s:5:"error";s:7:"details";s:509:"<p><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-down"></span>No alternative text has been found for these images. Alt tags are essential for SEO and accessibility. Please edit your images in the media library or using your preferred page builder, and provide alternative text.</p><ul class="attachments"><li class="attachment">Image missing alt text</li></ul><p>Please note that we scan all your source code, which means some missing alternative text for images may be found in your header, sidebar, or footer.</p>";}i:6;a:4:{s:5:"label";s:14:"Outbound Links";s:6:"status";s:7:"Warning";s:12:"status_class";s:7:"warning";s:7:"details";s:359:"<p>The internet is based on the concept of hyperlinks, so linking to different websites is completely natural. However, avoid linking to low-quality or spammy sites. If youre uncertain about a site quality, add the "nofollow" attribute to your link.</p><p><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-down"></span>This page does not contain any outbound links.</p>";}i:7;a:4:{s:5:"label";s:14:"Internal Links";s:6:"status";s:7:"Warning";s:12:"status_class";s:7:"warning";s:7:"details";s:360:"<p>Internal links are crucial for both SEO and user experience. Always aim to interconnect your content using meaningful and relevant anchor text.</p><p><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-down"></span>This page has no internal links from other content. Links from archive pages are not counted as internal links because they lack contextual relevance.</p>";}i:8;a:4:{s:5:"label";s:8:"Headings";s:6:"status";s:7:"Warning";s:12:"status_class";s:7:"warning";s:7:"details";s:1652:"<p><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-up"></span>Your Post Title is used as the primary H1 heading.</p><p><span class="dashicons dashicons-warning"></span>We found 1 additional Heading 1 (H1) tags in your content.</p><p>You should avoid using more than one H1 heading. The rule is simple: each web page should have only one primary H1 (usually the title), which benefits both SEO and accessibility. Below is the list of H1s found in content:</p><ul><li><span class="dashicons dashicons-arrow-right"></span>About David</li></ul><p><span class="dashicons dashicons-info"></span>Found 2 H2 heading(s)</p><ul><li><span class="dashicons dashicons-arrow-right"></span>I began my career in 2006, stepping into the world of professional videography and photography with a clear vision: to capture moments that matter and tell stories that resonate.I enjoy working in Manhattan and the tri-state area. I also travel to set up and manage shoots in Los Angeles, London, Washington, DC, Puerto Rico and anywhere else the client is based.</li><li><span class="dashicons dashicons-arrow-right"></span>About David</li></ul><p><span class="dashicons dashicons-info"></span>Found 6 H3 heading(s)</p><ul><li><span class="dashicons dashicons-arrow-right"></span>What I do</li><li><span class="dashicons dashicons-arrow-right"></span>How I execute it+</li><li><span class="dashicons dashicons-arrow-right"></span>How I execute it+</li><li><span class="dashicons dashicons-arrow-right"></span>How I execute it+</li><li><span class="dashicons dashicons-arrow-right"></span>My Approach</li><li><span class="dashicons dashicons-arrow-right"></span>Let''s Connect</li></ul>";}i:9;a:4:{s:5:"label";s:16:"Social Meta Tags";s:6:"status";s:5:"Error";s:12:"status_class";s:5:"error";s:7:"details";s:693:"<p><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-down"></span>Your Open Graph Title tag has not been set!</p><h4>Open Graph Description</h4><p><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-down"></span>Your Open Graph Description has not been set!</p><h4>Open Graph Image</h4><p><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-down"></span>Your Open Graph Image has not been set!</p><h4>X Title</h4><p><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-down"></span>Your X Title has not been set!</p><h4>X Description</h4><p><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-down"></span>Your X Description has not been set!</p><h4>X Image</h4><p><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-down"></span>Your X Image has not been set!</p>";}i:10;a:4:{s:5:"label";s:15:"Structured Data";s:6:"status";s:7:"Warning";s:12:"status_class";s:7:"warning";s:7:"details";s:130:"No local or global structured data (Schema.org) found. Adding structured data helps search engines understand your content better.";}i:11;a:4:{s:5:"label";s:21:"Keywords in Permalink";s:6:"status";s:5:"Error";s:12:"status_class";s:5:"error";s:7:"details";s:125:"<p><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-down"></span>You should include one of your target keywords in your permalink.</p>";}i:12;a:4:{s:5:"label";s:11:"Meta Robots";s:6:"status";s:4:"Good";s:12:"status_class";s:4:"good";s:7:"details";s:929:"<p data-robots="index"><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-up"></span><strong>noindex</strong> is disabled. Search engines will index this page.</p><p><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-up"></span><strong>nofollow</strong> is disabled. Search engines will follow links on this page.</p><p><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-up"></span><strong>noimageindex</strong> is disabled. Google will index the images on this page.</p><p><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-up"></span><strong>noarchive</strong> is disabled. Search engines will probably cache your page.</p><p><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-up"></span><strong>nosnippet</strong> is disabled. Search engines will display a snippet of this page in search results.</p><p><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-up"></span>We found no meta robots on this page. It means, your page is index,follow. Search engines will index it, and follow links. </p>";}i:13;a:4:{s:5:"label";s:18:"Last Modified Date";s:6:"status";s:4:"Good";s:12:"status_class";s:4:"good";s:7:"details";s:317:"<p><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-up"></span>The last modified date of this article is less than 1 year. Cool</p><p>Search engines love fresh content. Update regularly your articles without entirely rewriting your content and give them a boost in search rankings. SiteSEO takes care of the technical part</p>";}i:14;a:4:{s:5:"label";s:14:"Nofollow Links";s:6:"status";s:4:"Good";s:12:"status_class";s:4:"good";s:7:"details";s:104:"<p><span class="dashicons dashicons-thumbs-up"></span>This page does not contain any nofollow links.</p>";}i:15;a:1:{s:16:"paragraph_length";i:0;}}s:11:"total_score";d:51;}'),
