style="line-height:1.5"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img src="https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/david-camera-4.jpeg" alt="" class="wp-image-324 size-full" style="object-position:50% 50%"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {"animation":"fadeInUp","align":"full","style":{"color":{"background":"#202020"},"border":{"color":"#2f2f2f"}}} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-table alignfull"><table class="has-background has-border-color has-fixed-layout" style="background-color:#202020;border-color:#2f2f2f"><thead><tr><th>Role</th><th>What It Means</th><th>How I Execute It</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Live‑Stream Technical Director</td><td>Engineer, produce, and manage virtual and hybrid video broadcasts that keep audiences engaged in real time.</td><td>I build robust, scalable streaming solutions using VLAN, NDI, PTZ, 4‑ME, and broadcast‑grade video networking systems. From signal routing to on‑the‑fly troubleshooting, I ensure a flawless live‑stream experience.</td></tr><tr><td>Director of Photography</td><td>Lead the camera and lighting crews to translate a creative vision into striking visual imagery.</td><td>I collaborate with directors, designers, and clients to devise shot lists, lighting plans, and camera setups. On set, I coordinate the team, make real‑time creative decisions, and keep the production on schedule and on budget.</td></tr><tr><td>Photographer</td><td>Capture still images that complement live video content or stand alone as powerful marketing assets.</td><td>I specialize in live events/concerts, corporate portraits, and interviews, using a keen eye for composition, lighting, and storytelling to produce images that enhance the narrative.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"2em"} -->\n<div style="height:2em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">My Approach</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Creative Problem Solver</strong> – I view every technical challenge as an opportunity to innovate, turning potential obstacles into creative solutions.<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Team‑First Philosophy</strong> – Production thrives on collaboration. I work hand‑in‑hand with sound, lighting, post‑production, and creative teams to create a unified workflow that delivers the best possible product for my clients.<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Global Flexibility</strong> – While rooted in New York City, I’m comfortable traveling worldwide to set up and manage shoots wherever the client’s vision requires.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"2em"} -->\n<div style="height:2em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Let''s Connect</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you’re looking for a dedicated, technically savvy, and creatively driven professional to bring your video or photography project to life, whether it is a live event, a corporate interview, or a global brand campaign, let’s connect and start a conversation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[formlayer id="1"]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'About', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '43-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-05-27 12:55:28', '2026-05-27 16:55:28', '', 43, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=333', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
