e-height:1.6">If you’re looking for a dedicated, technically savvy, and creatively driven professional to bring your video or photography project to life, whether it is a live event, a corporate interview, or a global brand campaign, let’s connect and start a conversation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[formlayer id="1"]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'About David', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '43-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-05-27 13:08:51', '2026-05-27 17:08:51', '', 43, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=341', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
