I ensure a flawless livestream experience.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {"className":"animated fadeIn slow"} -->\n<div class="wp-block-column animated fadeIn slow"><!-- wp:heading {"level":4,"style":{"typography":{"fontStyle":"normal","fontWeight":"400"},"spacing":{"margin":{"bottom":"0"}}}} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading" style="margin-bottom:0;font-style:normal;font-weight:400">Director of Photography (DOP) </h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"lineHeight":1.6,"fontSize":"1.2em"}}} -->\n<p style="font-size:1.2em;line-height:1.6">I lead the camera and lighting crews to translate a creative vision into striking visual imagery.<br><br><em>How I Execute It</em><br>I collaborate with directors, designers, and clients to devise creative lighting plans, talent positions and camera setups. On set, I coordinate the team, make real‑time creative decisions, and keep the production on schedule and on budget.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {"className":"animated fadeIn slow"} -->\n<div class="wp-block-column animated fadeIn slow"><!-- wp:heading {"level":4,"style":{"typography":{"fontStyle":"normal","fontWeight":"400"},"spacing":{"margin":{"bottom":"0"}}}} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading" style="margin-bottom:0;font-style:normal;font-weight:400">Photographer</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"lineHeight":1.6,"fontSize":"1.2em"}}} -->\n<p style="font-size:1.2em;line-height:1.6">I capture still images that complement live video content or stand alone as powerful marketing assets. I also utilize the camera as a creative tool to capture emotion and beauty.<br><br><em>How I Execute It</em><br>I specialize in live events, corporate portraits, and interviews, using a keen eye for composition, lighting, and storytelling to produce images that enhance the narrative.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"2em"} -->\n<div style="height:2em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {"className":"animated fadeIn slow"} -->\n<div class="wp-block-columns animated fadeIn slow"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class="wp-block-column"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">My Approach</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {"style":{"typography":{"lineHeight":1.6,"fontSize":"1.2em"},"spacing":{"padding":{"right":"10vw"}}}} -->\n<ul style="padding-right:10vw;font-size:1.2em;line-height:1.6" class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item {"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"1em"}}} -->\n<li style="font-size:1em"><strong>Creative Problem Solver</strong><!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item {"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"0.9em"}}} -->\n<li style="font-size:0.9em">I view every technical challenge as an opportunity to innovate, turning potential obstacles into creative solutions.<br><br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Team‑First Philosophy</strong><!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item {"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"0.9em"}}} -->\n<li style="font-size:0.9em">Production thrives on collaboration. I work hand‑in‑hand with sound, lighting, post‑production, and creative teams to create a unified workflow that delivers the best possible product for my clients.<br><br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Global Flexibility</strong><!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item {"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"0.9em"}}} -->\n<li style="font-size:0.9em">While rooted in New York City, I’m comfortable traveling worldwide to set up and manage shoots wherever the client’s vision requires.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"2em"} -->\n<div style="height:2em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {"className":"animated fadeIn slow"} -->\n<div class="wp-block-columns animated fadeIn slow"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class="wp-block-column"><!-- wp:pagelayer/pl-divider {"pagelayer-id":"muc113"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Let''s Connect</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"lineHeight":1.6,"fontSize":"1.2em"}}} -->\n<p style="font-size:1.2em;line-height:1.6">If you’re looking for a dedicated, technically savvy, and creatively driven professional to bring your video or photography project to life, whether it is a live event, a corporate interview, or a global brand campaign, let’s connect and start a conversation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[formlayer id="1"]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->', 'About David', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '43-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-05-29 21:55:22', '2026-05-30 01:55:22', '', 43, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=466', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(467, 1, '2026-05-29 21:59:19', '2026-05-30 01:59:19', '<!-- wp:media-text {"align":"full","mediaPosition":"right","mediaId":324,"mediaLink":"https://davidkausek.com/david-camera-4/","linkDestination":"none","mediaType":"image","mediaWidth":60,"mediaSizeSlug":"full","verticalAlignment":"top","imageFill":true,"metadata":{"categories":["banner"],"patternName":"event","name":"Event"},"className":"animated fadeIn slow","style":{"color":{"background":"#202020","text":"#fffdc7"},"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"#f97f28"}}}}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-media-text alignfull has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-top is-image-fill-element animated fadeIn slow has-text-color has-background has-link-color" style="color:#fffdc7;background-color:#202020;grid-template-columns:auto 60%"><div class="wp-block-media-text__content"><!-- wp:group {"style":{"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"1em","right":"1em","bottom":"1em","left":"1em"}},"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"#fffdc7"}}}},"layout":{"type":"default"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-group has-link-color" style="padding-top:1em;padding-right:1em;padding-bottom:1em;padding-left:1em"><!-- wp:heading {"style":{"typography":{"fontWeight":"500","fontSize":"48px","lineHeight":"1.15","fontStyle":"normal","textTransform":"capitalize"}}} -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading" style="font-size:48px;font-style:normal;font-weight:500;line-height:1.15;text-transform:capitalize"></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"lineHeight":1.6,"fontSize":"1.25em"}}} -->\n<p style="font-size:1.25em;line-height:1.6">I began my career in 2006, stepping into the world of professional videography and photography with a clear vision: to capture moments that matter and tell stories that resonate. I enjoy working in Manhattan and the tri-state area. I also travel to set up and manage shoots in Los Angeles, London, Washington, DC, Puerto Rico and anywhere else the client is based.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img src="https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/david-camera-4.jpeg" alt="" class="wp-image-324 size-full" style="object-position:50% 50%"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"1em","metadata":{"blockVisibility":{"viewport":{"desktop":false}}}} -->\n<div style="height:1em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class="wp-block-columns"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class="wp-block-column"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"className":"animated fadeIn slow"} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading animated fadeIn slow">What I do</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {"metadata":{"blockVisibility":{"viewport":{"mobile":false}}},"align":"full","className":"is-style-regular animated fadeIn slow","style":{"color":{"background":"#202020"},"border":{"color":"#2f2f2f"},"css":".wp-block-table td, .wp-block-table th {\\n    vertical-align: top;\\n}","typography":{"fontSize":"1.2em"}}} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-table alignfull is-style-regular animated fadeIn slow has-custom-css" style="font-size:1.2em"><table class="has-background has-border-color has-fixed-layout" style="background-color:#202020;border-color:#2f2f2f"><thead><tr><th>Role</th><th>What It Means</th><th>How I Execute It</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Livestream Technical Director</td><td>Engineer, produce, and manage virtual and hybrid video broadcasts that keep audiences engaged in real time.</td><td>I build robust, scalable streaming solutions using professional cinema cameras, PTZ systems, VLAN, NDI, 4‑ME TD, and broadcast‑grade video networking systems. From signal routing to on‑the‑fly troubleshooting, I ensure a flawless livestream experience.</td></tr><tr><td>Director of Photography</td><td>Lead the camera and lighting crews to translate a creative vision into striking visual imagery.</td><td>I collaborate with directors, designers, and clients to devise creative lighting plans, talent positions and camera setups. On set, I coordinate the team, make real‑time creative decisions, and keep the production on schedule and on budget.</td></tr><tr><td>Photographer</td><td>Capture still images that complement live video content or stand alone as powerful marketing assets. I also utilize the camera as a creative tool to capture emotion and beauty.</td><td>I specialize in live events/concerts, corporate portraits, and interviews, using a keen eye for composition, lighting, and storytelling to produce images that enhance the narrative.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {"metadata":{"blockVisibility":{"viewport":{"desktop":false,"tablet":false}}},"style":{"color":{"gradient":"linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,206,166,0.16) 0%,rgba(255,46,46,0.28) 51%,rgba(0,0,0,0.22) 100%)"}}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-columns has-background" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,206,166,0.16) 0%,rgba(255,46,46,0.28) 51%,rgba(0,0,0,0.22) 100%)"><!-- wp:column {"className":"animated fadeIn slow"} -->\n<div class="wp-block-column animated fadeIn slow"><!-- wp:heading {"level":4,"style":{"typography":{"fontStyle":"normal","fontWeight":"400"},"spacing":{"margin":{"bottom":"0"}}}} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading" style="margin-bottom:0;font-style:normal;font-weight:400">Livestream Technical Director</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"lineHeight":1.6,"fontSize":"1.2em"}}} -->\n<p style="font-size:1.2em;line-height:1.6">I engineer, produce, and manage virtual and hybrid video broadcasts that keep audiences engaged in real time. <br><br><em>How I Execute It</em><br>I build robust, scalable streaming solutions using professional cinema cameras, PTZ systems, VLAN, NDI,  4‑ME TD, and broadcast‑grade video networking systems. From signal routing to on‑the‑fly troubleshooting, I ensure a flawless livestream experience.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {"className":"animated fadeIn slow"} -->\n<div class="wp-block-column animated fadeIn slow"><!-- wp:heading {"level":4,"style":{"typography":{"fontStyle":"normal","fontWeight":"400"},"spacing":{"margin":{"bottom":"0"}}}} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading" style="margin-bottom:0;font-style:normal;font-weight:400">Director of Photography (DOP) </h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"lineHeight":1.6,"fontSize":"1.2em"}}} -->\n<p style="font-size:1.2em;line-height:1.6">I lead the camera and lighting crews to translate a creative vision into striking visual imagery.<br><br><em>How I Execute It</em><br>I collaborate with directors, designers, and clients to devise creative lighting plans, talent positions and camera setups. On set, I coordinate the team, make real‑time creative decisions, and keep the production on schedule and on budget.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {"className":"animated fadeIn slow"} -->\n<div class="wp-block-column animated fadeIn slow"><!-- wp:heading {"level":4,"style":{"typography":{"fontStyle":"normal","fontWeight":"400"},"spacing":{"margin":{"bottom":"0"}}}} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading" style="margin-bottom:0;font-style:normal;font-weight:400">Photographer</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"lineHeight":1.6,"fontSize":"1.2em"}}} -->\n<p style="font-size:1.2em;line-height:1.6">I capture still images that complement live video content or stand alone as powerful marketing assets. I also utilize the camera as a creative tool to capture emotion and beauty.<br><br><em>How I Execute It</em><br>I specialize in live events, corporate portraits, and interviews, using a keen eye for composition, lighting, and storytelling to produce images that enhance the narrative.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"2em"} -->\n<div style="height:2em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {"className":"animated fadeIn slow"} -->\n<div class="wp-block-columns animated fadeIn slow"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class="wp-block-column"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">My Approach</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {"style":{"typography":{"lineHeight":1.6,"fontSize":"1.2em"},"spacing":{"padding":{"right":"10vw"}}}} -->\n<ul style="padding-right:10vw;font-size:1.2em;line-height:1.6" class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item {"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"1em"}}} -->\n<li style="font-size:1em"><strong>Creative Problem Solver</strong><!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item {"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"0.9em"}}} -->\n<li style="font-size:0.9em">I view every technical challenge as an opportunity to innovate, turning potential obstacles into creative solutions.<br><br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Team‑First Philosophy</strong><!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item {"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"0.9em"}}} -->\n<li style="font-size:0.9em">Production thrives on collaboration. I work hand‑in‑hand with sound, lighting, post‑production, and creative teams to create a unified workflow that delivers the best possible product for my clients.<br><br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Global Flexibility</strong><!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item {"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"0.9em"}}} -->\n<li style="font-size:0.9em">While rooted in New York City, I’m comfortable traveling worldwide to set up and manage shoots wherever the client’s vision requires.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"2em"} -->\n<div style="height:2em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {"className":"animated fadeIn slow"} -->\n<div class="wp-block-columns animated fadeIn slow"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class="wp-block-column"><!-- wp:pagelayer/pl-divider {"pagelayer-id":"muc113"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Let''s Connect</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"lineHeight":1.6,"fontSize":"1.2em"}}} -->\n<p style="font-size:1.2em;line-height:1.6">If you’re looking for a dedicated, technically savvy, and creatively driven professional to bring your video or photography project to life, whether it is a live event, a corporate interview, or a global brand campaign, let’s connect and start a conversation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[formlayer id="1"]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->', 'About David', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '43-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-05-29 21:59:19', '2026-05-30 01:59:19', '', 43, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=467', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
