(827, 2, '2026-07-22 16:35:57', '2026-07-22 20:35:57', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Born among a digital paradigm shift<br>There lives a child with curious eyes<br>A spirit full of love and surprise<br><br>Her smile like the rising sun<br>A golden glow upon the horizon<br>Illuminates the Earth<br><br>Her eyes like diamonds glimmering with the ocean<br>Filling the world with vibrant colors<br>An artist with an effortless brush<br><br>Her eyes like diamonds glimmering with the ocean <br>Filling the world with vibrant colors <br>An artist with an effortless brush<br><br>Her laugh sings through the valleys of joy<br>Reminding us of the moment of our own birth<br>The wonders of life ever-present in distant memories<br><br>Her skin as sweet as the color of honey<br><br>This rainbow child, a life <br>Sings the song of cosmic angels <br>Her melody reminding us to look beyond the tragedy of death <br>And all those dreams that could have been<br><br>For all the unborn souls who faded too soon…<br><br>A moment of silence….<br><br>Those “little beans” that brought great joy <br>Before dying like the embers of a fire extinguished by violent rain <br>Bringing tears that flowed from the mountains <br>Washing away the pain and grief <br>A silent suffering shared by many <br>A taboo to speak the truth<br><br>With resonant sounds <br>The words sung with meaning <br>Reminds us of what it means to be human<br><br>This beautiful rainbow child shines bright against the darkest of skies <br>In a world of hope and a world of lies <br>Her majestic smile has the power to melt the ice of the coldest adult hearts<br><br>This child looks up at the fresh blue sky <br>Not knowing the cycles before her <br>All is full of wonder and curiosity <br>A reflection of our innermost being<br><br>With clarity <br>A beam of light <br>Parts the fog of modern distortions<br><br>The child can be heard across the land <br>Echoing the potentialities of what “can become” <br>The future grasped by little hands <br>So warm and loving <br>As fragile as a falling snowflake <br>Blanketing the forest filled with birds<br><br>This infant An ember in our hearts <br>Gazes upon the world with wonder and delight <br>Her smile is such an amazing sight <br>A divine beauty beyond words <br>Fills our mouth with silence <br>There are no words to express this feeling<br><br>We walk a path altered by new decisions <br>A journey traveled by our ancestors<br><br>Angelic spirits of light <br>Caress the faces of innocent beings<br><br>A fragrant wind <br>A lotus unfolds on the surface of a still lake <br>The most ancient mirror<br><br>A message in a bottle <br>Drifting towards us with magnetic force <br>What words were they trying to form? <br>A vibration of the soul <br>A gift from beyond<br><br>This parallel reality <br>Full of dimension <br>Time And space<br><br>We gaze upon the clear blue skies <br>With an obscure reminder of the most obscene <br>The most ancient cycles.. <br>All that lives must die <br>(Rebirth)<br><br>The sun shown bright <br>A moon circling the sphere<br><br>This cosmic song of the universe cannot be recorded<br><br>Only experienced directly <br>Through the subtle lens of observation<br><br>The curiosity of the mind <br>Reflects the truth of our being<br><br>The child shines bright <br>With tears of joy and delight<br><br>With the purity of heart, <br>Her voice can be heard <br>A landscape <br>A canvas <br>A child of art<br><br>Isobel Anaya <br>Daddy loves you forever and always <br>An eternal flame<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>An original poem by David Kausek.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'This curious child gazes skyward', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '818-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-22 16:35:57', '2026-07-22 20:35:57', '', 818, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=827', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
