<!-- wp:comments-pagination -->\n<!-- wp:comments-pagination-previous /-->\n\n<!-- wp:comments-pagination-numbers /-->\n\n<!-- wp:comments-pagination-next /-->\n<!-- /wp:comments-pagination -->\n\n<!-- wp:post-comments-form /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:comments --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {"slug":"footer","theme":"davidk-theme","tagName":"footer"} /-->', 'Single Posts', 'Displays a single post on your website unless a custom template has been applied to that post or a dedicated template exists.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '114-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-23 15:56:07', '2026-07-23 19:56:07', '', 114, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=876', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(878, 1, '2026-07-23 15:57:26', '2026-07-23 19:57:26', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>He sees the world through infinite perspectives.<br><br>A product of mind.<br>A lover of nature and computation.<br><br>Art is the expression of his magic.<br>His emotions are connected to his soul: abstractions induced by humanity’s reflections.<br>A modern day ancient being.<br><br>His actions are guided by intuition.<br>A dreamer who travels the universe within his mind.<br>The essence of freedom confined to body: a product of our time.<br><br>He presses his pallete towards his face and examines the pigments abstracted from Earth: a portal to another world.<br>So many hues and tones refracting light: such beauty surrounding space.<br><br>Each color pulsing with energy.<br>The abstraction of song embedded in paint: encoding meaning.<br>The sacred studio: a portal to another world.<br><br>Digital beings<br>Digital avatars<br>Digital daydreams</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Filling the void of the unknown<br><br>Child of creation.<br>Go forth and be free.<br>Let the world see its beauty!!!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Original poem by David Kausek 2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'CHILD OF ART: birth of creation', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '813-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-23 15:57:26', '2026-07-23 19:57:26', '', 813, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=878', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(879, 2, '2026-07-23 15:59:21', '2026-07-23 19:59:21', '<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"animated fadeIn delay-200ms slow","style":{"color":{"gradient":"radial-gradient(rgb(255,245,203) 0%,rgb(182,227,212) 50%,rgb(51,167,181) 100%)"},"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|black"}}},"typography":{"textAlign":"center"}},"textColor":"black"} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-center animated fadeIn delay-200ms slow has-black-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color" style="background:radial-gradient(rgb(255,245,203) 0%,rgb(182,227,212) 50%,rgb(51,167,181) 100%)">Do dreams have dreams?<br>(Asked the sleeping child)<br><strong><br></strong>In the mind of an artist<br><br>The world becomes a language of symbols<br><br>Some ancient<br>Some modern<br>Some revealing<br>Some misleading<br><br>The world is a canvas<br>An expressive field of reciprocity<br><br>All things outside echo within<br>All things inside project outward<br><br>What does it mean to be human?<br><br>Emotions are states of consciousness<br>Biochemical currents within the brain<br>Conjuring a solid sense of now<br><br>The heart beats faster<br>The blood moves quicker<br>Cortisol levels rise<br><br>Perception is power<br>A frame assembled in the mind<br>A portrait shaped from concept<br><br>The artist breathes life into the inanimate<br>Words, notes, and pigments<br>Dreaming through experience<br><br>Truth lives within abstraction<br>The soul of the artist becomes a passage<br>Like a forest trail guiding perception<br><br>Each time the experiencer crosses the path<br>The scenery subtly alters<br>The trail bends almost unnoticed<br><br>The state of consciousness is a portal<br>A doorway into presence<br>An invitation into dreaming<br><br>Words are pigments of the mind<br>Spoken through the canvas of imagination<br>Fragments of understanding<br><br>The child awakens<br>A dream within a dream</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:pagelayer/pl-badge {"badge_text":"","badge_url":"","pagelayer-id":"qyp8733"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original poetic sketch by David Kausek 2026</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:pagelayer/pl-image {"id":678,"pagelayer-id":"p4s8615","tmpAtts":{"id-full-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/dreaming-child.jpg","id-thumbnail-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/dreaming-child-150x150.jpg","id-medium-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/dreaming-child-225x300.jpg","id-medium_large-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/dreaming-child-768x1024.jpg","id-large-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/dreaming-child-768x1024.jpg","id-1536x1536-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/dreaming-child-1152x1536.jpg","id-2048x2048-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/dreaming-child.jpg","id-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/dreaming-child.jpg","id-alt":"dreaming child","id-title":"dreaming child","id-link":"https://davidkausek.com/dreaming-child/"}} -->\n<p>Lorem Ipsum has been the industry''s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s.</p>\n<!-- /wp:pagelayer/pl-image -->', 'Do dreams have dreams?', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '738-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-23 15:59:21', '2026-07-23 19:59:21', '', 738, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=879', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
