(953, 2, '2026-07-23 17:50:06', '2026-07-23 21:50:06', '<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"center"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-center">In the waking of Spring<br>I am child laughing at the “sun”<br><br>New seeds rise from “Earth”<br>Reaching towards the “sky”<br><br>Energy bursting forward<br>Traversing the bridge of annihilation<br><br>The renewal of rain<br>Unleashing the earthy fragrance of fungi<br><br>A rainbow of colors emerge<br>Vibrant reds, greens, yellows, pinks, blues<br><br>New smells awaken this stale “air”<br>Microscopic particles entering one’s body<br><br>In a hurried rush to live,<br>Birds sing their melodies<br><br>A cosmic egg<br>Manifesting physical dimensions of life<br><br>Mystical experiences<br>Entertaining abstraction of reality<br><br>Peering into the nature of atoms<br>An attempt to transcend the mundane<br><br>Metaphorical observations of the metaphysical<br>Allegorical symbols birthing science<br><br>The spirit of breathe<br>Caressing trees<br><br>Clear springs sculpting terra firma<br>Tears of heaven washing away the chaos<br><br>Time marches forward<br>As grief lags behind<br><br>The dichotomy of “being”<br>Now and then<br><br>As above<br>So below<br><br>Life flows through everything<br>Tools are necessary to perceive<br><br>Religion<br>Science<br><br>What is a life?<br>Scientific data collected upon entry and exit?<br><br>Biological info condensed to numeric values?<br>An entire “being” summed up via stats?<br><br>Life is a journey<br>All growth comes through change<br><br>Nothing lasts forever<br>Nothing stays the same<br><br>An old man passing through the woods<br>Walking above the presence of death<br><br>Countless lifeforms have come before him<br>Countless lifeforms will come after him<br><br>The ancient cycles cannot be altered<br>No physical monument can sustain time<br><br>All things are left unfinished<br>All things are incomplete<br><br>The process of birth<br>Inevitably leads to the process of death<br><br>We are but visitors<br>Observing the great mysteries<br><br>Spirit<br>Eternal</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original poem by David Kausek 2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'The Second Season', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '944-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-23 17:50:06', '2026-07-23 21:50:06', '', 944, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=953', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
