(971, 2, '2026-07-23 17:58:49', '2026-07-23 21:58:49', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Falling from the sky<br>With the grace of wind<br><br>A smile cannot pretend<br>Words like “love” and “friend”<br><br>An echo from the past<br>Haunting the streets of his childhood<br><br>Walking those dreams<br>From once upon a time<br><br>A beautiful pattern<br>Dancing in light and shadow<br><br>The interplay of complexity<br>Simplified by mind<br><br>Compassion warming the heart<br>From a cold blank space<br><br>Memories of love<br>Filling the void<br><br>Like water in a chalice<br>Releasing all malice<br><br>Forgiveness from fragile beings<br>Holding together, exterior strength<br><br>Like a healer purifying the land<br>He touches time with his hand<br><br>One cannot hold the intangible<br>Or grasp the meaning of infinity<br><br>Through complex processes<br>This poison must be dissolved<br><br>The clarity of water<br>Flowing through a peaceful stream<br><br>Symbolic sacrifices<br>Invoking the spirit of nature<br><br>Dynamic dimensions of time<br>Acting on perceptions internal<br><br>Knowledge of our ancestors<br>Guided by the eternal dreamer<br><br>Encoded information<br>Hidden within the mundane<br><br>In the flatness of a prairie<br>Where heaven touches the plains<br><br>One cannot lose contact with “human”<br>The essential self buried in distraction<br><br>Alchemical matter<br>A construct of the mind<br><br>Piercing the veil of Maya<br>A puzzle to be solved<br><br>The silence of a monk<br>Sacred is the vow<br><br>An image of the world<br>Transformed by the hands of an artist<br><br>The studio is his sanctuary<br>Holy acts of creation<br><br>Lifting the souls of man<br>Silence filling space<br><br>A counterweight to hatred and destruction<br>This hall of mirrors, society’s construction<br><br>A deep blue shadow<br>Wrapping around a face<br><br>A piece of the the soul<br>Captured like amber in oil<br><br>An open canvas<br>Expressing change<br><br>Like clarity in water</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Filtered by action<br><br>Organic matter<br>Transferred into words<br><br>Enigmatic presence<br>Never waking from God’s dream</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original poem by David Kausek 2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', '"Glittering Gold"', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '962-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-23 17:58:49', '2026-07-23 21:58:49', '', 962, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=971', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
