efined under reading settings. If it exists, the Front Page template overrides this template when posts are shown on the homepage.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '263-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-23 19:56:42', '2026-07-23 23:56:42', '', 263, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=990', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
