(1038, 2, '2026-07-23 20:51:41', '2026-07-24 00:51:41', '<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"center"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-center">We are a changin''<br><br>Adaptation<br>Flexibility<br>Agility<br>Strength<br><br>Of mind<br>Of body<br><br>We embody<br>A digital shift<br><br>A life of augmentation<br><br>Look around…<br>Intelligence abound<br><br>In all things<br><br>Everywhere<br><br>At all times<br><br>Recorded…<br><br>To be replayed<br>And understood<br><br>Through memory<br>Through mind<br><br>Be kind<br>Rewind<br><br>The world is what we make it<br>Project positivity<br><br>Don’t fake it<br><br>Be real<br>Be you<br>Be alive<br><br>And strive<br>To thrive<br>In a world that is ever-changing<br><br>Always and forever<br>For eternity<br><br>Life is but a dream<br>And we all dreamers<br>Projecting our gifts into this world<br><br>A holographic display<br>Of all that is beautiful<br><br>Nightmares are distortions<br>Animalistic projections of fear<br><br>Life is change<br>Forever and always<br><br>Open your eyes and see.<br>It is 2023!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'in "these times of change"', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '791-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-23 20:51:41', '2026-07-24 00:51:41', '', 791, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1038', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
