mitations and we strive to push forward and explore new horizons.<br><br>The sun rises and sets according to our perspective on this spinning sphere of life, the seasons come and go,<br>And in the end, our matter returns to the earth below and there is always work left undone.<br><br>Our legacy lives on in the lives we touched.<br>It lives through the laughter we shared.<br>In the memories we made, and in the love we expand outward in all directions.<br><br>The sacred cycle of life, is like a circle and each person is the center of that circle, expanding and contracting. <br>We chose to create and we chose to destroy, as we nourish the Yin and Yang of our beings.<br><br>Irregardless of the choices we make,<br>This planet continues to spin,<br>And we are all a part of it, from beginning to end.<br><br>Never forget that which is good, <br>Never let the darkness of space <br>Steal the light of your sun!<br><br>Carry on and lift as many as you can while you can.<br><br>Life is simple.<br>Life is complex.<br><br>We are fragments of the puzzle known as life. <br>The greatest mystery is not control, but harmony—the work of balancing the forces inside us with the forces that shape the universe.</pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original poem by David Kausek 2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:pagelayer/pl-image {"id":1119,"id-size":"large","pagelayer-id":"jwc9068","tmpAtts":{"id-full-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/sunglasses.jpg","id-thumbnail-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/sunglasses-150x150.jpg","id-medium-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/upload