mitations and we strive to push forward and explore new horizons.<br><br>The sun rises and sets according to our perspective on this spinning sphere of life, the seasons come and go,<br>And in the end, our matter returns to the earth below and there is always work left undone.<br><br>Our legacy lives on in the lives we touched.<br>It lives through the laughter we shared.<br>In the memories we made, and in the love we expand outward in all directions.<br><br>The sacred cycle of life, is like a circle and each person is the center of that circle, expanding and contracting. <br>We chose to create and we chose to destroy, as we nourish the Yin and Yang of our beings.<br><br>Irregardless of the choices we make,<br>This planet continues to spin.<br>We are all a part of life, from beginning to end.<br><br>Never forget that which is good, <br>Never let the darkness of space <br>Steal the light of your sun!<br><br>Carry on and lift as many as you can while you can.<br><br>Life is simple.<br>Life is complex.<br><br>We are fragments of the puzzle known as life. <br>The greatest mystery is not control, but harmony—the work of balancing the forces inside us with the forces that shape the universe.</pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original poem by David Kausek 2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:pagelayer/pl-image {"id":1119,"id-size":"large","pagelayer-id":"jwc9068","tmpAtts":{"id-full-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/sunglasses.jpg","id-thumbnail-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/sunglasses-150x150.jpg","id-medium-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/sunglasses-225x300.jpg","id-medium_large-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/sunglasses-768x1024.jpg","id-large-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/sunglasses-768x1024.jpg","id-1536x1536-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/sunglasses-1152x1536.jpg","id-2048x2048-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/sunglasses.jpg","id-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/sunglasses.jpg","id-alt":"sunglasses","id-link":"https://davidkausek.com/2026/07/23/the-sacred-cycle/sunglasses/"}} -->\n<p>Lorem Ipsum has been the industry''s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s.</p>\n<!-- /wp:pagelayer/pl-image -->', 'The Sacred Cycle', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '975-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-24 13:55:17', '2026-07-24 17:55:17', '', 975, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1142', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1143, 2, '2026-07-24 13:57:24', '2026-07-24 17:57:24', '<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"center"},"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"#a2d9fb"}}},"color":{"text":"#a2d9fb"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color" style="color:#a2d9fb">He sees the world through infinite perspectives.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"center"},"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"#8dd3ff"}}},"color":{"text":"#8dd3ff"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color" style="color:#8dd3ff"><br>A product of mind.<br>A lover of nature and computation.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"center"},"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"#7eb9fe"}}},"color":{"text":"#7eb9fe"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color" style="color:#7eb9fe">Art is the expression of his magic.<br>His emotions are connected to his soul: abstractions induced by humanity’s reflections.<br>A modern day ancient being.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"center"},"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"#5da9ff"}}},"color":{"text":"#5da9ff"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color" style="color:#5da9ff">His actions are guided by intuition.<br>A dreamer who travels the universe within his mind.<br>The essence of freedom confined to body: a product of our time.<br><br>He presses his pallete towards his face and examines the pigments abstracted from Earth: a portal to another world.<br>So many hues and tones refracting light: such beauty surrounding space.<br><br>Each color pulsing with energy.<br>The abstraction of song embedded in paint: encoding meaning.<br>The sacred studio: a portal to another world.<br><br>Digital beings.<br>Digital avatars.<br>Digital daydreams.<br><br>Filling the void of the unknown<br><br>Child of creation.<br>Go forth and be free.<br>Let the world see its beauty!!!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right"><br><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original poem by David Kausek 2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'CHILD OF ART: birth of creation', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '813-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-24 13:57:24', '2026-07-24 17:57:24', '', 813, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1143', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1144, 1, '2026-07-24 13:58:13', '2026-07-24 17:58:13', '<!-- wp:cover {"url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/nature04-1024x768.jpg","id":211,"hasParallax":true,"dimRatio":80,"overlayColor":"custom-dark-gray","isUserOverlayColor":true,"minHeight":340,"contentPosition":"center center","sizeSlug":"large","layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-cover has-parallax" style="min-height:340px"><div class="wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-211 size-large has-parallax" style="background-position:50% 50%;background-image:url(https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/nature04-1024x768.jpg)"></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-cover__background has-custom-dark-gray-background-color has-background-dim-80 has-background-dim"></span><div class="wp-block-cover__inner-container"><!-- wp:heading {"className":"animated fadeIn slow","style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|custom-link-red"}}}},"textColor":"custom-link-red"} -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading animated fadeIn slow has-custom-link-red-color has-text-color has-link-color">Heading</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"animated fadeIn slow","style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|white"}}}},"textColor":"white"} -->\n<p class="animated fadeIn slow has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color">Lorem ipsum</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button {"className":"animated fadeIn slow is-style-fill","style":{"border":{"width":"2px","radius":{"topLeft":"32px","topRight":"32px","bottomLeft":"32px","bottomRight":"32px"}},"spacing":{"padding":{"left":"24px","right":"24px","top":"10px","bottom":"10px"}}}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-button animated fadeIn slow is-style-fill"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" style="border-width:2px;border-top-left-radius:32px;border-top-right-radius:32px;border-bottom-left-radius:32px;border-bottom-right-radius:32px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:24px">Button</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n\n<!-- wp:button {"className":"animated fadeIn slow is-style-fill","style":{"border":{"width":"2px","radius":{"topLeft":"32px","topRight":"32px","bottomLeft":"32px","bottomRight":"32px"}},"spacing":{"padding":{"left":"24px","right":"24px","top":"10px","bottom":"10px"}}}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-button animated fadeIn slow is-style-fill"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" style="border-width:2px;border-top-left-radius:32px;border-top-right-radius:32px;border-bottom-left-radius:32px;border-bottom-right-radius:32px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:24px">Button</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->', 'Hero', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1132-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-24 13:58:13', '2026-07-24 17:58:13', '', 1132, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1144', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1145, 2, '2026-07-24 13:58:29', '2026-07-24 17:58:29', '<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|pale-cyan-blue"}}},"typography":{"textAlign":"center"}},"textColor":"pale-cyan-blue"} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-center has-pale-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-link-color">Among the sandy dunes and starry night.<br>There lies a flower amidst the vastness of nothing.<br>Its petals soft and delicate, yet strong.<br>As it blooms in the desert without witness.<br><br>In the darkness, it''s a sight to behold.<br>Its beauty shimmers like precious gold.<br>As the winds howl and the sands shift.<br>The flower stands firm, a desert gift.<br><br>Its color vibrant, like a fire''s flame.<br>A symbol of hope in a land so tame.<br>For in the emptiness of the arid plain.<br>This flower''s resilience is not in vain.<br><br>It survives in a place where life is rare.<br>A testament to the power of nature''s flair.<br>In the stillness of the moonlit night.<br>The desert flower shines so bright.<br><br>Oh, desert flower, you are a wonder.<br>A treasure in a land torn asunder.<br>In the darkness, you bring us light.<br>A symbol of hope, in the plight.<br><br>We live in a world of division.<br>Forgottten love exchanged for hatred.<br>A grab bag of data in isolation.<br>You are nothing but an accumulation of data.<br><br>Extrapolate/buy/sell/human simian.<br><br>Dehumanizing the present moment!<br><br>Your life is suffocated by false realities!<br>“Fear that which you do not comprehend!!!”<br><br>Child.<br>Night.<br>Light.<br><br>Illuminating this moment.<br><br>Embraced by the statues quo.<br>Cash out!<br>Sell out!!<br>Upload!!!<br><br>Be the “unoriginal being of fear!"<br>Be....<br> CONTROLLED!!!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right"><br><br><br>Original poem by David Kausek 2023<br><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Desert Flower''s Darkness', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '834-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-24 13:58:29', '2026-07-24 17:58:29', '', 834, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1145', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1146, 2, '2026-07-24 14:00:42', '2026-07-24 18:00:42', '<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"left"},"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|pale-cyan-blue"}}}},"textColor":"pale-cyan-blue"} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-left has-pale-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-link-color">New York City<br>The epitome of one’s dream<br>The Illusionist selling distractions<br>A empty promise to fill a void<br>A man laughing paranoid<br>Safety is not guaranteed<br>Only the possibility of passage<br>The tunnel is a portal<br>Dirty and distorted<br>The grime behind the curtain<br>A sickly green light overhead<br>A thin coat of paint<br>Strange smells from strange people<br>A physical illness of a system<br>Built to favor motorists<br>The price of a ride<br>Sometimes magical<br>Sometimes violent<br>But most often mundane<br>A rat preaching to the roaches<br>Partial cognition of a troubled soul<br>The message has no meaning<br>Intentions are good… perhaps??<br>A ego massage for the clown without a pulpit<br>His message has no meaning<br>Only sounds of concern<br>Causing even more concern<br>Dog whistles for the mentally ill<br>Subservient to a system of control<br>“All hail king dumbass!”<br>The jester frowns in dissatisfaction<br>A corporate tool used to extract value<br>Chasing phantoms of material wealth<br>A soulless body<br>An empty shell<br>Too afraid to grow<br>No ghost in his machine<br>Best replaced by a bot<br>Bossman say “why not?”<br>He will not be missed<br>Fortunes gained by those left behind<br>A sketch of reality<br>Cognitive bias<br>The mind searches for patterns<br>Trying to make sense of the senseless<br>Bury your head in fear<br>There is no shelter here<br>All aboard the absurdity express<br>Wow, the subway!<br>I’m impressed!!!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original poem by David Kausek 2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:pagelayer/pl-image {"id":803,"pagelayer-id":"ycz1982","tmpAtts":{"id-full-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/sitting-on-the-subway.jpg","id-thumbnail-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/sitting-on-the-subway-150x150.jpg","id-medium-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/sitting-on-the-subway-240x300.jpg","id-medium_large-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/sitting-on-the-subway-768x960.jpg","id-large-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/sitting-on-the-subway-819x1024.jpg","id-1536x1536-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/sitting-on-the-subway.jpg","id-2048x2048-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/sitting-on-the-subway.jpg","id-url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/sitting-on-the-subway.jpg","id-alt":"sitting on the subway","id-title":"sitting on the subway","id-link":"https://davidkausek.com/2026/07/22/sitting-on-the-subway/sitting-on-the-subway/"}} -->\n<p>Lorem Ipsum has been the industry''s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s.</p>\n<!-- /wp:pagelayer/pl-image -->', 'Sitting on the subway', 'New York City.  The epitome of one''s dream.  The illusionist selling distractions.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '800-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-24 14:00:42', '2026-07-24 18:00:42', '', 800, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1146', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1148, 1, '2026-07-24 14:09:21', '2026-07-24 18:09:21', '<!-- wp:cover {"overlayColor":"custom-darker-gray","isUserOverlayColor":true,"minHeight":340,"contentPosition":"center center","sizeSlug":"large","layout":{"type":"constrained","contentSize":"1000px"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-cover" style="min-height:340px"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-cover__background has-custom-darker-gray-background-color has-background-dim-100 has-background-dim"></span><div class="wp-block-cover__inner-container"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"className":"animated fadeIn slow","style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"center","fontSize":"1.8em"}},"fontFamily":"system-font"} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center animated fadeIn slow has-system-font-font-family" style="font-size:1.8em">Need photos for headshots, events, or fine art?  INSERT INTO `wpk3_posts` VALUES
