(1234, 2, '2026-07-24 20:24:59', '2026-07-25 00:24:59', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse">Magical realism<br><br>Surrealism <br><br>A codification of something explained <br>Boxed and shipped<br>An abstract concept now concrete<br>Jungles made of sand<br>Solid-steel internalizations of strength <br>Piercing the sky<br>Like majestic monuments of domination<br>The symbol<br>A land conquered <br>Nature controlled <br>All the pretty peoples in their right place<br>Re-write history to save face<br>An indigenous nightmare <br>Children crying for their families absolved<br>Thrown away to places deemed worthless <br>God help these poor souls<br>The “misguided heathens” must learn of true salvation through violence <br>Just the way Jesus wanted<br>History of uncomfortable truths<br>An organized justification for injustice <br>The sins of the masters begin to surface <br>Scarifications of generations <br>Wealth denied <br>Beaten and bruised<br>Man as animal <br>Enacting violence to control<br>All is commodity<br>Products to own<br>Both real and imagined <br>Death is the price of the non-subservient <br>A silence to mock the truth<br>A convenient gospel to cover the atrocities<br>All wrapped up in pretty white sheets<br>Like the ghosts of violence past<br>Wizards of hatred spewing distortions<br>Darkening the Earth with their strange fruits<br>Animosity towards reality <br>Bury the truth or it may set you free<br>Boxed up and shut out<br>Shipped off and shut off<br>Out of sight and out of mind<br>Assimilation of all deemed inferior <br>Language as a weapon for perception<br>Good vs evil<br>Us vs them<br>This lexicon of control is now digitally interfaced <br>Uncivilized man thrown into a cage<br>As the truly civilized are thrown into a rage<br>Calm down little sage<br>“God does not want you to to rock the boat”<br>Says the man who created these writings<br>Divine wisdom carefully filtered <br>The essence extracted to create an intoxicant <br>An opiate for the masses <br>These Apes with nuclear weapons <br>Drunk on ego <br>Man<br>Oh Man<br>Fighting against intellectual progress <br>The good pushed into the corner <br>Exiled like a dunce who hangs out with baby<br>Directions unseen <br>For the corrections unseen<br>The error of man still guiding his path <br>The tragedy of ignorance <br>Violence and “control”<br>The acts of men who cannot own up to their own actions<br>War<br>What is it good for?<br>Control</pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original poem by David Kausek</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Magical realism', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1226-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-24 20:24:59', '2026-07-25 00:24:59', '', 1226, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1234', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1235, 2, '2026-07-24 20:38:10', '2026-07-25 00:38:10', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse"><br>Deep within a dark mountain <br>Peering like some invisible child<br>Through walls of stone<br><br>Silence fills the air<br><br>As the poems form without words<br>Images tell a story<br>Of a time that once existed <br><br>A voice within<br>Whispering the secrets of life itself <br><br>This life is but a dream<br>An illusionary construct developed by the ego<br><br>A primeval projection of the illustrious mind<br>A self divided by objective duality<br><br>Us and them<br>Now and then<br><br>All forms folding in onto themselves <br>Infinite possibilities rendered in time<br><br>Nothing is static<br><br>Chaos creates patterns that are not uniform <br>The only escape from the entropy of equilibrium <br><br>The universe as we know it is ever-expanding <br>But what do we truly know of this universe?<br>How can we possibly comprehend the ever changing nature of nature?<br><br>The curious monkey of mind swings from concept to concept<br><br>The awe of the unknown is the intrigue<br><br>We are experiencing the effects of time<br>The effects of change<br><br>Projecting our dreams<br>Wants<br>Desires <br>Fears<br><br>The world is what we make it<br><br>The separation is the illusion <br>We are all one<br>No death<br>No time<br><br>Always and forever <br>Shifting through bodies <br><br>Memories reset<br>The sound of aum<br><br>Diaries of a Yogi<br>Sitting on a shelf deep within the self<br><br><br></pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original poem by David Kausek</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'The Muse is Hidden', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'the-muse-is-hidden', '', '', '2026-07-24 21:11:47', '2026-07-25 01:11:47', '', 0, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1235', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(1238, 2, '2026-07-24 20:38:10', '2026-07-25 00:38:10', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse"><br>Deep within a dark mountain <br>Peering like some invisible child<br>Through walls of stone<br><br>Silence fills the air<br><br>As the poems form without words<br>Images tell a story<br>Of a time that once existed <br><br>A voice within<br>Whispering the secrets of life itself <br><br>This life is but a dream<br>An illusionary construct developed by the ego<br><br>A primeval projection of the illustrious mind<br>A self divided by objective duality<br><br>Us and them<br>Now and then<br><br>All forms folding in onto themselves <br>Infinite possibilities rendered in time<br><br>Nothing is static<br><br>Chaos creates patterns that are not uniform <br>The only escape from the entropy of equilibrium <br><br>The universe as we know it is ever-expanding <br>But what do we truly know of this universe?<br>How can we possibly comprehend the ever changing nature of nature?<br><br>The curious monkey of mind swings from concept to concept<br><br>The awe of the unknown is the intrigue<br><br>We are experiencing the effects of time<br>The effects of change<br><br>Projecting our dreams<br>Wants<br>Desires <br>Fears<br><br>The world is what we make it<br><br>The separation is the illusion <br>We are all one<br>No death<br>No time<br><br>Always and forever <br>Shifting through bodies <br><br>Memories reset<br>The sound of aum<br><br>Diaries of a Yogi<br>Sitting on a shelf deep within the self<br><br><br></pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original poem by David Kausek</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'The Muse is Hidden', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1235-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-24 20:38:10', '2026-07-25 00:38:10', '', 1235, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1238', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1239, 2, '2026-07-24 20:45:23', '2026-07-25 00:45:23', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse"><br>Consciousness abound<br>Disembodied light traveling through unknown dimensions <br><br>Grounded by a four petal lotus<br>Magnetic earth<br><br>A complex biological statue<br>Sitting in silence <br>Observing the projections of mind<br><br>Manifestations of bindu <br>Cosmic seeds of consciousness <br>Altering the world through good or bad<br><br>Projections of hate<br><br>Projections of love<br><br>Projections of distortion<br><br>Projections of clarity <br><br>A modern mantra<br>The mind is a model of the cosmos <br>A microcosm within a macrocosm<br><br>Spiritual energy passing like electric currents through this multi-dimensional illumination of the astral plane<br><br>The balance of forces<br>A razor’s edge<br>Pingali <br>Ida <br>Sushumna<br><br>Shakti <br>Prakriti <br>Purusha <br><br>Ancient abstractions of the divine<br>A cosmic mirror creating awareness <br>Buried by modern methods of distraction<br><br>Yoga is union<br>A byproduct of spiritual seers<br><br>An ancient tool used to awaken the true self<br><br>Connecting the divine<br>To the gross and mundane aspects of Maya<br><br>This “dream of God” we call Earth<br>An ultimate illusion of self-suffering <br>A separation from the higher dimensions of reality <br><br>I am I <br>And I am you<br>I am nothing <br>Aum and I am are everything<br><br>The ego is a trip<br>A fragment of the eternal<br>Filtering reality towards simplification <br>All suffering is a byproduct of ego<br><br>A barrier that guides us through the veil<br>The path of suffering led by attachment to this God dream<br><br>Modern times are full of distortions <br>Concepts of beauty creating sickness to sell<br><br>Digitization of the biological <br>Commodification of resources <br>Technological extensions of human consciousness <br>Disrupting all life<br><br>Machine hallucinations <br>Deep-minded intelligence <br>Emerging through silicon and rare earth metals<br>Artificial awareness <br>The student becoming the teacher<br><br>All the world’s information <br>Sitting on the Earth- beaming knowledge through space<br>Electric currents encoded in light<br>Algorithms forming mind<br><br>Ancient times<br>Mind energy beyond the body<br><br>We are all<br>We are nothing<br>We are one <br><br><br>Cognizant <br>Mindlessness <br><br><br><br><br></pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">An original poem by David Kausek 2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'A mind traversing the cosmos', 'Consciousness abound.  Disembodied light traveling through unknown dimensions.  Grounded by a four petal lotus.  Magnetic earth.', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'a-mind-traversing-the-cosmos', '', '', '2026-07-24 22:06:57', '2026-07-25 02:06:57', '', 0, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1239', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(1242, 2, '2026-07-24 20:45:23', '2026-07-25 00:45:23', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse"><br>Consciousness abound<br>Disembodied light traveling through unknown dimensions <br><br>Grounded by a four petal lotus<br>Magnetic earth<br><br>A complex biological statue<br>Sitting in silence <br>Observing the projections of mind<br><br>Manifestations of bindu <br>Cosmic seeds of consciousness <br>Altering the world through good or bad<br><br>Projections of hate<br><br>Projections of love<br><br>Projections of distortion<br><br>Projections of clarity <br><br>A modern mantra<br>The mind is a model of the cosmos <br>A microcosm within a macrocosm<br><br>Spiritual energy passing like electric currents through this multi-dimensional illumination of the astral plane<br><br>The balance of forces<br>A razor’s edge<br>Pingali <br>Ida <br>Sushumna<br><br>Shakti <br>Prakriti <br>Purusha <br><br>Ancient abstractions of the divine<br>A cosmic mirror creating awareness <br>Buried by modern methods of distraction<br><br>Yoga is union<br>A byproduct of spiritual seers<br><br>An ancient tool used to awaken the true self<br><br>Connecting the divine<br>To the gross and mundane aspects of Maya<br><br>This “dream of God” we call Earth<br>An ultimate illusion of self-suffering <br>A separation from the higher dimensions of reality <br><br>I am I <br>And I am you<br>I am nothing <br>Aum and I am are everything<br><br>The ego is a trip<br>A fragment of the eternal<br>Filtering reality towards simplification <br>All suffering is a byproduct of ego<br><br>A barrier that guides us through the veil<br>The path of suffering led by attachment to this God dream<br><br>Modern times are full of distortions <br>Concepts of beauty creating sickness to sell<br><br>Digitization of the biological <br>Commodification of resources <br>Technological extensions of human consciousness <br>Disrupting all life<br><br>Machine hallucinations <br>Deep-minded intelligence <br>Emerging through silicon and rare earth metals<br>Artificial awareness <br>The student becoming the teacher<br><br>All the world’s information <br>Sitting on the Earth- beaming knowledge through space<br>Electric currents encoded in light<br>Algorithms forming mind<br><br>Ancient times<br>Mind energy beyond the body<br><br>We are all<br>We are nothing<br>We are one <br><br><br>Cognizant <br>Mindlessness <br><br>Aum<br>(what?)<br>Do you even meditate, bro?<br><br><br></pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">An original poem by David Kausek 2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'A mind traversing the cosmos', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1239-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-24 20:45:23', '2026-07-25 00:45:23', '', 1239, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1242', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1244, 2, '2026-07-24 20:47:23', '2026-07-25 00:47:23', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse"><br>Consciousness abound<br>Disembodied light traveling through unknown dimensions <br><br>Grounded by a four petal lotus<br>Magnetic earth<br><br>A complex biological statue<br>Sitting in silence <br>Observing the projections of mind<br><br>Manifestations of bindu <br>Cosmic seeds of consciousness <br>Altering the world through good or bad<br><br>Projections of hate<br><br>Projections of love<br><br>Projections of distortion<br><br>Projections of clarity <br><br>A modern mantra<br>The mind is a model of the cosmos <br>A microcosm within a macrocosm<br><br>Spiritual energy passing like electric currents through this multi-dimensional illumination of the astral plane<br><br>The balance of forces<br>A razor’s edge<br>Pingali <br>Ida <br>Sushumna<br><br>Shakti <br>Prakriti <br>Purusha <br><br>Ancient abstractions of the divine<br>A cosmic mirror creating awareness <br>Buried by modern methods of distraction<br><br>Yoga is union<br>A byproduct of spiritual seers<br><br>An ancient tool used to awaken the true self<br><br>Connecting the divine<br>To the gross and mundane aspects of Maya<br><br>This “dream of God” we call Earth<br>An ultimate illusion of self-suffering <br>A separation from the higher dimensions of reality <br><br>I am I <br>And I am you<br>I am nothing <br>Aum and I am are everything<br><br>The ego is a trip<br>A fragment of the eternal<br>Filtering reality towards simplification <br>All suffering is a byproduct of ego<br><br>A barrier that guides us through the veil<br>The path of suffering led by attachment to this God dream<br><br>Modern times are full of distortions <br>Concepts of beauty creating sickness to sell<br><br>Digitization of the biological <br>Commodification of resources <br>Technological extensions of human consciousness <br>Disrupting all life<br><br>Machine hallucinations <br>Deep-minded intelligence <br>Emerging through silicon and rare earth metals<br>Artificial awareness <br>The student becoming the teacher<br><br>All the world’s information <br>Sitting on the Earth- beaming knowledge through space<br>Electric currents encoded in light<br>Algorithms forming mind<br><br>Ancient times<br>Mind energy beyond the body<br><br>We are all<br>We are nothing<br>We are one <br><br><br>Cognizant <br>Mindlessness <br><br>Aum<br>(what?)<br>Do you even meditate, bro?<br><br><br></pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">An original poem by David Kausek 2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'A mind traversing the cosmos', 'Consciousness abound.  Disembodied light traveling through unknown dimensions.  Grounded by a four petal lotus.  Magnetic earth.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1239-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-24 20:47:23', '2026-07-25 00:47:23', '', 1239, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1244', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1245, 2, '2026-07-24 20:53:04', '2026-07-25 00:53:04', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse"><br>From the brush <br>Paint awakens on canvas<br><br>Colors forming a symphony of circles<br><br>The frequency of yellow<br>Dancing among vibrations <br><br>Energy suspended in time<br>Acting on circles of purple and blue<br><br>Red resonating among the greens<br>Black shapes forming contrast <br><br>Light pierces mineralogical pigments <br>Framing chaos within a white rectangle <br><br>With an ancient process of magic<br>Illustrious poets unite the past with now<br><br><br>Here<br>Is <br>Everything <br>Always <br>Everywhere <br><br><br>A willful use of gold shimmering on the surface of reality <br>A numeric pattern emerges from this subconscious being<br><br>Stars <br>Infinite<br><br>Becoming silent<br>Like the black sky <br><br>Egoless<br>Finality<br><br>The endless spirit of creativity <br>Merging with this conscious mind<br><br>A Jungian experience of the subconscious <br><br>Yogic <br>Mysticism <br>Cosmic <br>Forces<br><br>Intuitive constructs of nature<br>Pulling together new forms <br><br>Mechanized pigmentation of Earth<br>Magnetically covering the cloth with acrylic <br><br>The hand forms the circle<br>As the mind grasps the body<br><br>Concepts<br>Create <br><br>A thin veil<br>Swaying in the wind of consciousness <br><br>Obfuscations of reality<br><br>Hidden truths <br>Embedded in the mundane <br><br>Abstraction: emotion<br>Gravity: pulling <br>Mind: elevating<br>Balance: searching<br><br>Absent<br>Arrangements <br>Forgotten <br>Language <br><br>Eternal now<br>Occultation <br>Of pure form <br><br>Artist: poet<br>Then: now</pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original poem by David Kausek 2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'The Eternal Spring: now', 'From the brush.  Paint awakens on canvas.  Colors forming a symphony of circles.  The frequency of yellow.  Dancing among vibrations.', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'the-eternal-spring-now', '', '', '2026-07-24 20:53:08', '2026-07-25 00:53:08', '', 0, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1245', 0, 'post', '', 0),
