(1258, 2, '2026-07-24 21:06:38', '2026-07-25 01:06:38', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse">Enigmatic devices<br>Capturing the dreams of now<br><br>Telecommunications from a derelict society <br>Pushing out the nonsense of anti-intellectualism<br><br>There is no magic in this realism<br>A prism of falsities presented as realities<br><br>Digital beings<br><br>Communicating with frequencies we have yet to discover<br><br>An ancient ocean overlapping this one <br><br>An obolisk as a grounding device <br>Connecting the energy of the earth</pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original sci-fi poem by David Kausek 2022</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Science/fiction', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1254-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-24 21:06:38', '2026-07-25 01:06:38', '', 1254, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1258', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1259, 2, '2026-07-24 21:08:29', '2026-07-25 01:08:29', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse">In dreams<br>Life is just one reality<br>A flicker that feels so real<br>Physically bound<br>By a body<br>The mind is still free to wonder<br></pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original poem by David Kausek 2022</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'In Dreams', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'in-dreams', '', '', '2026-07-24 22:18:11', '2026-07-25 02:18:11', '', 0, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1259', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(1262, 2, '2026-07-24 21:08:29', '2026-07-25 01:08:29', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse">In dreams<br>Life is just one reality<br>A flicker that feels so real<br>Physically bound<br>By a body<br>The mind is still free to wonder<br></pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original poem by David Kausek 2022</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'In Dreams', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1259-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-24 21:08:29', '2026-07-25 01:08:29', '', 1259, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1262', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1263, 2, '2026-07-24 21:21:34', '2026-07-25 01:21:34', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse"><br><br>The mind attempts to focus<br>The world becomes blurred<br><br>Like a truth obscured <br>A reality impossible to ascertain <br><br>A silent space opens within the meditation chamber <br><br>Like a vortex encircling a living statue<br>The mind pierces this veil of illusion <br><br>All finite dimensions merge into an infinite construct<br>The observances of energy traveling through the body<br><br>Information in the form of light<br>Traveling within the vast voids between molecular structures <br><br>From this lens,<br>The body appears to be a gigantic universe <br><br>Fear is reduced to a primal reaction <br>The mystery is beyond trepidation <br><br>All infinity contained within finite space<br>Like the concept of dividing a meter into an infinite number of fragments<br>The numeric division becomes a pure concept that can no longer be replicated in the world of matter<br>It becomes a pure abstraction<br><br>A metaphysical cowboy riding the bull of reason<br>Trying hard to hold on to his small reality<br><br>Death destroys the monument of self <br><br>The ego is dissolved<br><br>The mind enters an ancient portal <br><br>The entire cosmos is awakened <br><br>The center is not the center<br>It is merely a reference point to reassemble infinite possibilities within a circle of awareness <br><br>Time and space are illusions<br>The world is Maya<br>That which is not bound by time exists outside of time<br><br>It passes through time but remains untouched <br>A rendezvous with atman<br></pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original poem by David Kausek March 6th, 2022</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Spinning Through An Ancient Void:', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'spinning-through-an-ancient-void', '', '', '2026-07-24 21:21:38', '2026-07-25 01:21:38', '', 0, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1263', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(1266, 1, '2026-07-24 21:13:33', '2026-07-25 01:13:33', '<!-- wp:cover {"url":"https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/20151005202811-221fb275-me.jpg","id":194,"isRepeated":true,"dimRatio":80,"overlayColor":"custom-dark-gray","isUserOverlayColor":true,"focalPoint":{"x":0.51,"y":0.03},"minHeight":360,"contentPosition":"top left","sizeSlug":"full","style":{"spacing":{"padding":{"left":"3%","top":"8vh","bottom":"4vh"}}},"layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-cover is-repeated has-custom-content-position is-position-top-left" style="padding-top:8vh;padding-bottom:4vh;padding-left:3%;min-height:360px"><div class="wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-194 size-full is-repeated" style="background-position:51% 3%;background-image:url(https://davidkausek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/20151005202811-221fb275-me.jpg)"></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-cover__background has-custom-dark-gray-background-color has-background-dim-80 has-background-dim"></span><div class="wp-block-cover__inner-container"><!-- wp:heading {"className":"animated fadeIn slow","style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|custom-link-red"}}}},"textColor":"custom-link-red"} -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading animated fadeIn slow has-custom-link-red-color has-text-color has-link-color">Capture Your Story</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"animated fadeIn slow","style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|white"}}},"typography":{"fontSize":"1.3em","lineHeight":"1.5"},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"0.5em","bottom":"0em"}}},"textColor":"white"} -->\n<p class="animated fadeIn slow has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color" style="padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0em;font-size:1.3em;line-height:1.5">Professional photography tailored for headshots, weddings, events, and fine‑arts. INSERT INTO `wpk3_posts` VALUES
(1268, 2, '2022-03-02 21:24:19', '2022-03-03 01:24:19', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse"><br><br>An ancient connection in the age of lost modernity.<br>Flowing through matter for all eternity.<br><br>The physical resides within this dimension of spacetime.<br><br>A beacon flickering in  the cosmos like a distant star.<br><br>Billions of worlds overlapping each-other.<br><br>Your perception is guided by consciousness.<br>Deep within, the seed mantra can be heard.<br><br>A shadow of self.<br>Projected into reality.<br>Walking through this waking dream.<br>Peering through the cracks of this illusion.<br>A sordid nightmare probing your deepest fears without permission.<br>A man-made hierarchical construct of control.<br>The illusion surrounds you.<br>Like a carnival funhouse projecting fire in the mirrors of smoke.<br>The jester is the king.<br>Bumbling to the empty theater of fools.<br>Echoing in their chambers of hatred and sadness.<br>Madness is the message of “these crazy times.”<br>Death comes via commodification.<br>Abstractions of reality. <br>Held up by the mythologies of grandiosity.<br>The illusion lurks in  the dark spaces within your mind.<br>Controlling through fear and oppression.<br>The screen-projections instruct you how to think.<br>Concepts of superiority and entitlements.<br>The sheep bow to the wolf.<br><br>Living in a realm where happiness can only be achieved through the acquisitions of objects outside self and a sense of identity.<br>The entity exists in the form of abstraction only.<br><br>The great mythos of “what matters.”<br>Forcing you to sell your freedoms to obtain the objects of your desire.<br>Briefly filling that void in all mankind.<br><br>Acquisition is the byproduct of enslavement.<br>Happiness in the form of objects.<br>Matter arranged according to ideals.<br>The free spirit can never be enslaved.<br>It flows through the prisons of the mind and matter.<br>Traversing through the physicality of the invisible.<br>For all eternity.<br>Flickering  like a distant star in the vast blackness of space.<br>A homing beacon.<br><br>The breath of life passes through changes.<br>Instantly transmuting the landscape of now.<br><br>Life is but a dream within a dream.<br>A simulation of the holographic mind.<br><br>As the poets travel through time dilation.<br>They stand at the edge of the universe.<br>Laughing at the leviathans of their time.<br><br>Without warning.<br><br>The poets disappear back into the noise of golden silence.<br>Like ancient alchemists giving birth to the chemistries and mysteries of now.<br>Gawk the poets.<br>Never.<br>More.</pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original sci-fi poem by David Kausek March 2nd, 2022</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'The/Poet Breathes/Through Symbols/', '', 'private', 'open', 'open', '', 'the-poet-breathes-through-symbols', '', '', '2026-07-24 22:07:57', '2026-07-25 02:07:57', '', 0, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1268', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(1271, 2, '2026-07-24 21:24:19', '2026-07-25 01:24:19', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse"><br><br>An ancient connection in the age of lost modernity.<br>Flowing through matter for all eternity.<br><br>The physical resides within this dimension of spacetime.<br><br>A beacon flickering in  the cosmos like a distant star.<br><br>Billions of worlds overlapping each-other.<br><br>Your perception is guided by consciousness.<br>Deep within, the seed mantra can be heard.<br><br>A shadow of self.<br>Projected into reality.<br>Walking through this waking dream.<br>Peering through the cracks of this illusion.<br>A sordid nightmare probing your deepest fears without permission.<br>A man-made hierarchical construct of control.<br>The illusion surrounds you.<br>Like a carnival funhouse projecting fire in the mirrors of smoke.<br>The jester is the king.<br>Bumbling to the empty theater of fools.<br>Echoing in their chambers of hatred and sadness.<br>Madness is the message of “these crazy times.”<br>Death comes via commodification.<br>Abstractions of reality. <br>Held up by the mythologies of grandiosity.<br>The illusion lurks in  the dark spaces within your mind.<br>Controlling through fear and oppression.<br>The screen-projections instruct you how to think.<br>Concepts of superiority and entitlements.<br>The sheep bow to the wolf.<br><br>Living in a realm where happiness can only be achieved through the acquisitions of objects outside self and a sense of identity.<br>The entity exists in the form of abstraction only.<br><br>The great mythos of “what matters.”<br>Forcing you to sell your freedoms to obtain the objects of your desire.<br>Briefly filling that void in all mankind.<br><br>Acquisition is the byproduct of enslavement.<br>Happiness in the form of objects.<br>Matter arranged according to ideals.<br>The free spirit can never be enslaved.<br>It flows through the prisons of the mind and matter.<br>Traversing through the physicality of the invisible.<br>For all eternity.<br>Flickering  like a distant star in the vast blackness of space.<br>A homing beacon.<br><br>The breath of life passes through changes.<br>Instantly transmuting the landscape of now.<br><br>Life is but a dream within a dream.<br>A simulation of the holographic mind.<br><br>As the poets travel through time dilation.<br>They stand at the edge of the universe.<br>Laughing at the leviathans of their time.<br><br>Without warning.<br><br>The poets disappear back into the noise of golden silence.<br>Like ancient alchemists giving birth to the chemistries and mysteries of now.<br>Gawk the poets.<br>Never.<br>More.</pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original sci-fi poem by David Kausek March 2nd, 2022</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'The/Poet Breathes/Through Symbols/', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1268-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-24 21:24:19', '2026-07-25 01:24:19', '', 1268, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1271', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1272, 2, '2026-07-24 21:31:59', '2026-07-25 01:31:59', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse"><br>She shines internally <br>From an ancient internal spring<br>Her soul radiates through her eyes<br>Vibrations of love pass through her body<br>Permeating every breath she takes<br>Converting negative spaces into positive places<br>Illuminating the dark recesses of my soul<br>Pain dissolves as I let go of fear and embrace her<br>I fall back into the nothingness I came from<br>Surrendering my ego as my body folds into geometric patterns of flow. <br>Weightless <br>The mind becomes free<br>Relieved of the monkey within<br>Thoughts cease to swing from branch to branch<br>The animal is tamed as the charioteer takes the reins<br>I feel my spirit shine <br>There is no attachment to suffering<br>Happiness, sadness, anger<br>Emotions of the lower self<br>The mind becomes a laser<br>Burning through ignorance and fear <br>No barriers to hold me down<br>A levitation within the mind<br>Time is temporarily bent<br>Warmth surrounds me as geometric shapes display in tribal mosaics<br>What/who is the essential self? <br>The self beyond ego.<br>The interconnected self.<br>My body pulses with electricity and I smile<br>As I fold my body into geometric shapes.<br>Cosmic love<br>Joy, like a child clutching a cherished object<br>Eternal love<br>What are we beyond the ego<br>Beyond the box<br>Beyond the confines of sex, race, religion and social status?<br>Are we animals who shine with the light of the divine within?<br>What am I but ego?<br>Rene Descartes would say “I think therefore I am” does that mean we are nothing without our thoughts? <br><br>What is ego?<br>A filtered perception of all there is?<br>What would happen if we were to temporarily remove that filter?<br>Lift the vale and peer into the eternal?<br>Would we recognize ourselves?<br>Would we be too afraid to let go?<br>Are our lives anything more than a highly restricted perspective of reality?<br><br><br>In stillness <br>The chaos of the world is seen for what it is<br>A distraction from higher states of being<br>With each pause<br>The program of anxiety is debugged <br>The mind slowly heals itself from all trauma As the mind unravels the truth<br>Sometimes there is pain but pain is just an emotion that attempts to hold you back <br>With each breath, you slowly accept that which has happened to you<br>Like a warrior of peace who must pick up the bodies left by the devastation of war<br>Emotions bubble up from within <br>You learn to uproot the toxic seeds within your being before they mature and drain your time and energy<br><br>The discipline of yoga is a tool<br>An ancient technology that has existed for thousands of years<br>Through repetition and concentration <br>The power of the spirit is polished<br>Like a diamond trapped beneath the earth<br>All the blocked pathways begin to flow<br>As you undo the darkness of your world<br>Over time<br>Light fills the soul<br>Like cutting out a window through a brick wall.<br>The realization that the mind wants to hold onto everything <br>The realization that there are so many things designed to distract you from accepting yourself…<br><br>Love<br>She shows all that I am afraid to see<br>I breath in and the energy of the universe <br>A multi-dimensional being traversing the planes unseen<br><br>Spirit<br><br>Life<br></pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original sci-fi poem by David Kausek March 2nd, 2022</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Primordial Radiance', '', 'private', 'open', 'open', '', 'primordial-radiance', '', '', '2026-07-24 21:32:00', '2026-07-25 01:32:00', '', 0, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1272', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(1275, 2, '2026-07-24 21:31:59', '2026-07-25 01:31:59', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse"><br>She shines internally <br>From an ancient internal spring<br>Her soul radiates through her eyes<br>Vibrations of love pass through her body<br>Permeating every breath she takes<br>Converting negative spaces into positive places<br>Illuminating the dark recesses of my soul<br>Pain dissolves as I let go of fear and embrace her<br>I fall back into the nothingness I came from<br>Surrendering my ego as my body folds into geometric patterns of flow. <br>Weightless <br>The mind becomes free<br>Relieved of the monkey within<br>Thoughts cease to swing from branch to branch<br>The animal is tamed as the charioteer takes the reins<br>I feel my spirit shine <br>There is no attachment to suffering<br>Happiness, sadness, anger<br>Emotions of the lower self<br>The mind becomes a laser<br>Burning through ignorance and fear <br>No barriers to hold me down<br>A levitation within the mind<br>Time is temporarily bent<br>Warmth surrounds me as geometric shapes display in tribal mosaics<br>What/who is the essential self? <br>The self beyond ego.<br>The interconnected self.<br>My body pulses with electricity and I smile<br>As I fold my body into geometric shapes.<br>Cosmic love<br>Joy, like a child clutching a cherished object<br>Eternal love<br>What are we beyond the ego<br>Beyond the box<br>Beyond the confines of sex, race, religion and social status?<br>Are we animals who shine with the light of the divine within?<br>What am I but ego?<br>Rene Descartes would say “I think therefore I am” does that mean we are nothing without our thoughts? <br><br>What is ego?<br>A filtered perception of all there is?<br>What would happen if we were to temporarily remove that filter?<br>Lift the vale and peer into the eternal?<br>Would we recognize ourselves?<br>Would we be too afraid to let go?<br>Are our lives anything more than a highly restricted perspective of reality?<br><br><br>In stillness <br>The chaos of the world is seen for what it is<br>A distraction from higher states of being<br>With each pause<br>The program of anxiety is debugged <br>The mind slowly heals itself from all trauma As the mind unravels the truth<br>Sometimes there is pain but pain is just an emotion that attempts to hold you back <br>With each breath, you slowly accept that which has happened to you<br>Like a warrior of peace who must pick up the bodies left by the devastation of war<br>Emotions bubble up from within <br>You learn to uproot the toxic seeds within your being before they mature and drain your time and energy<br><br>The discipline of yoga is a tool<br>An ancient technology that has existed for thousands of years<br>Through repetition and concentration <br>The power of the spirit is polished<br>Like a diamond trapped beneath the earth<br>All the blocked pathways begin to flow<br>As you undo the darkness of your world<br>Over time<br>Light fills the soul<br>Like cutting out a window through a brick wall.<br>The realization that the mind wants to hold onto everything <br>The realization that there are so many things designed to distract you from accepting yourself…<br><br>Love<br>She shows all that I am afraid to see<br>I breath in and the energy of the universe <br>A multi-dimensional being traversing the planes unseen<br><br>Spirit<br><br>Life<br></pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original sci-fi poem by David Kausek March 2nd, 2022</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Primordial Radiance', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1272-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-24 21:31:59', '2026-07-25 01:31:59', '', 1272, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1275', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1276, 2, '2026-07-24 21:36:55', '2026-07-25 01:36:55', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse"><br>PAINT FLOWS FROM THE SOUL<br>Dripping its essence onto nothing <br><br>Colors meld into forms <br>Filling blank spaces with energy <br><br>Projections of the inner-being<br>Vibrating like a song captured in images<br><br>Reflections of complexity<br>Simplified into emotions<br><br>The brush moves in all directions <br>Circles that follow the mechanics of body<br><br>The curvature of one’s hand<br>Becomes a compass<br><br>An organic coalescence of body and mind<br>Formations emerge from nowhere <br><br>Subtle acts of intuition <br>Playfully defying logic <br><br>Subconscious pattens emerge<br>Chaos gives birth to new structures <br><br>A triangle creates stability by maintaining a primordial balance <br>Between substance and void<br><br>Echos of the past projected into the future <br>Cognitive experiences pass through the moment we call “now”<br><br>Nature is a muse <br>Unamused by ignorance <br><br>The artist stands at the precipice <br>Receiving an ancient signal<br>The heart pulses with inspiration <br><br>A deep stirring of forces<br>Urges the body into action<br><br>The restless spirit lives on<br>Forming a visual tapestry of art<br><br>A symphony of visions<br>Alchemical origins <br><br>DaVinci<br>Madici <br><br>Illuminating the mind with wisdom<br>Crushed lapis lazuli enchanting old masters <br><br>The earth of Sienna creating scorched perfection among the vineyards<br><br>The mortar  and pestle releasing a hidden spectrum of potentialities suspended in oil<br>Activated by light and the mind<br><br>William Blake<br>Painting <br>Poetry<br><br>Ephemeral substances of imagination <br>Etched into history <br><br>Water renews the brush<br>As colorful pigments are washed away<br><br>The tools are reset<br><br>Inspiration returns to its origin <br><br>Awaiting the guidance of mind<br><br>Through contemplations and meditations<br>The artist creates a document of experience<br><br>Reactivated by the viewer<br>A chemical reaction<br><br>Taking place in the mind<br>An easel within one’s skull</pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original poem by David Kausek February 28th, 2022</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Paint Flows From the Soul', 'PAINT FLOWS FROM THE SOUL. Dripping its essence onto nothing.  Colors meld into forms.  Filling blank spaces with energy.', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'paint-flows-from-the-soul', '', '', '2026-07-24 21:38:20', '2026-07-25 01:38:20', '', 0, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1276', 0, 'post', '', 0),
