(1280, 2, '2026-07-24 21:38:19', '2026-07-25 01:38:19', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse"><br>PAINT FLOWS FROM THE SOUL<br>Dripping its essence onto nothing <br><br>Colors meld into forms <br>Filling blank spaces with energy <br><br>Projections of the inner-being<br>Vibrating like a song captured in images<br><br>Reflections of complexity<br>Simplified into emotions<br><br>The brush moves in all directions <br>Circles that follow the mechanics of body<br><br>The curvature of one’s hand<br>Becomes a compass<br><br>An organic coalescence of body and mind<br>Formations emerge from nowhere <br><br>Subtle acts of intuition <br>Playfully defying logic <br><br>Subconscious pattens emerge<br>Chaos gives birth to new structures <br><br>A triangle creates stability by maintaining a primordial balance <br>Between substance and void<br><br>Echos of the past projected into the future <br>Cognitive experiences pass through the moment we call “now”<br><br>Nature is a muse <br>Unamused by ignorance <br><br>The artist stands at the precipice <br>Receiving an ancient signal<br>The heart pulses with inspiration <br><br>A deep stirring of forces<br>Urges the body into action<br><br>The restless spirit lives on<br>Forming a visual tapestry of art<br><br>A symphony of visions<br>Alchemical origins <br><br>DaVinci<br>Madici <br><br>Illuminating the mind with wisdom<br>Crushed lapis lazuli enchanting old masters <br><br>The earth of Sienna creating scorched perfection among the vineyards<br><br>The mortar  and pestle releasing a hidden spectrum of potentialities suspended in oil<br>Activated by light and the mind<br><br>William Blake<br>Painting <br>Poetry<br><br>Ephemeral substances of imagination <br>Etched into history <br><br>Water renews the brush<br>As colorful pigments are washed away<br><br>The tools are reset<br><br>Inspiration returns to its origin <br><br>Awaiting the guidance of mind<br><br>Through contemplations and meditations<br>The artist creates a document of