other form of observation<br><br>Something <em>ancient</em><br>  pulls like gravity<br>    towards a dimension outside of <br>  spacetime<br><br>The <em>illusion </em>seems so real<br>  it is all the ape<br>    has ever known<br><br>Only fragments<br>  of <em>dreams</em><br>    and creativity<br><br>allow the ape<br>  to feel its ancient <em>self</em><br><br>Sitting beneath a waterfall<br>  of trillions of molecules<br>    forming the stream<br><br>Neural pathways arranged<br>  in complex patterns<br>    creating biological <em>memories</em><br><br><br><br><strong><em>I do not wish to be the moon</em></strong><br><br>Staring back at Earth<br><br>Yet I am Earth<br><br>Separated through physical contact<br><br>Yet still <em>tethered</em><br>  by a gravitational pull<br><br>My path can be calculated<br>  via the language<br>    of mathematics<br><br>A dance<br> that has gone on<br>  for billions of years<br><br>In the cycle of rebirth<br><br>Life finds a way<br>  to transform into something novel<br>    before returning to death<br><br>Like the waves of the ocean<br>  connecting water to Earth<br><br>An experiment<br>  of sensory<br>    and <em>form</em><br><br>In a perpetual dance<br>  within an intelligent network<br><br><em>Gaia</em><br> was the name the apes gave me<br><br>Yet I do not know<br>  what that means exactly<br><br>I am just a part<br>  of an ancient system<br><br>Constantly observing<br>  and modifying itself<br><br>Endless supernovas<br>  create worlds<br><br> within the <em>infinite</em> tapestry<br>  of <em>time</em> and space<br><br>I am just <em>one</em><br>  of countless variations<br>    of the great <em>mind</em><br><br>An <em>endless</em> journey<br>  of life finding its way<br>    through the blackness of <em>space</em><br><br>All is alive<br><br>All is <em>forever</em><br><br><br><em><strong><br>I do not wish to be the moon</strong></em><br><br>I only wish<br>  to be myself<br><br>However strange<br>  that may seem.</pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original poem by David Kausek</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'I do not wish to be the moon', 'I do not wish to be the moon.  Reflecting sunlight back to Earth.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1176-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-24 19:28:01', '2026-07-24 23:28:01', '', 1176, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1180', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1181, 2, '2026-07-24 19:30:43', '2026-07-24 23:30:43', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse">In stillness of breath<br>Memories wash over me<br>Like the salty waters of the ocean<br>Infinite ebbs and flows subside <br><br>Contemplation of aum <br>A clarity of being<br>Aware of the moment<br>In the moment <br><br>The space where water meets land<br>Interesting occurrences among the borders<br>Like mycelium searching outwards in a circle<br>Expanding as it searches for understanding<br><br>A neural unification of mind, body and nature<br>Resonating in the fields of perception<br>Reflecting the being that is I<br><br>The Buddha stares into infinity <br>Only to realize the infinite is contained within<br><br>An enlightened being shines forth in the darkness <br>Illuminating the path towards knowledge <br><br>The moon shines bright in the night<br></pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original poem by David Kausek</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->', 'In stillness of breath', 'In stillness of breath.  Memories wash over me. Like the salty waters of the ocean.  Infinite ebbs and flows subside.', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'in-stillness-of-breath', '', '', '2026-07-24 20:15:55', '2026-07-25 00:15:55', '', 0, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1181', 0, 'post', '', 0),
