(1185, 2, '2026-07-24 19:31:41', '2026-07-24 23:31:41', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse">In stillness of breath<br>Memories wash over me<br>Like the salty waters of the ocean<br>Infinite ebbs and flows subside <br><br>Contemplation of aum <br>A clarity of being<br>Aware of the moment<br>In the moment <br><br>The space where water meets land<br>Interesting occurrences among the borders<br>Like mycelium searching outwards in a circle<br>Expanding as it searches for understanding<br><br>A neural unification of mind, body and nature<br>Resonating in the fields of perception<br>Reflecting the being that is I<br><br>The Buddha stares into infinity <br>Only to realize the infinite is contained within<br><br>An enlightened being shines forth in the darkness <br>Illuminating the path towards knowledge <br><br>The moon shines bright in the night<br></pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original peom by David Kausek</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'In stillness of breath', 'In stillness of breath.  Memories wash over me. Like the salty waters of the ocean.  Infinite ebbs and flows subside.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1181-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-24 19:31:41', '2026-07-24 23:31:41', '', 1181, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1185', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
