(1211, 2, '2026-07-24 20:04:32', '2026-07-25 00:04:32', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse"><br><br>The eye of the beholder <br>Getting older<br><br>Ever present <br>Loss of gain<br><br>A reflective self<br>Witnessing time unfold <br><br>Forever changing<br>The essence of you<br><br>Meditative spaces<br>A room within the mind<br><br>Inner exploration<br>Of roads less traveled <br><br>Metaphorical constructs illuminating<br>Guideposts in silence<br><br><br>Fear not <br><br><br><br><br>The void<br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br>Unspoken truths<br><br>Wordless spaces<br>Intercepting images<br><br>Perfect arrangements of mind<br>Balancing energy <br><br>Biological patterns<br>Striving for symmetry <br><br>The crystallization of concepts <br><br><br><br>Creating<br><br><br><br>Fragments of completion <br><br>Life is beautiful <br>Beautiful is life <br><br>Completion of fragments <br><br>Creating <br><br>Concepts of Crystallization (The)<br><br>Symmetry of striving<br>Patterns / biological <br>Energy / Balancing<br>Mind of arrangements<br><br> Perfect<br>Images intercepting<br><br><br>Spaces <br><br><br>Word(less)<br>Truths (un)spoken<br><br>a pattern disrupted<br>(mental image incomplete)<br><br>fragmented<br>order<br><br>Void <br>the<br>Not fear<br><br>Silence in signposts<br>Illuminating construct’s metaphorical <br>Travels less roads of exploration <br>inner<br>Mind <br>the with <br>room a<br><br>Spaces <br>Meditative <br><br>You<br>Of<br>Essence<br>Cha gong<br><br>Beauty is order</pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original poem by David Kausek</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:pagelayer