(1231, 2, '2026-07-24 20:22:13', '2026-07-25 00:22:13', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse">Magical realism<br><br>Surrealism <br><br>A codification of something explained <br>Boxed and shipped<br>An abstract concept now concrete<br>Jungles made of sand<br>Solid-steel internalizations of strength <br>Piercing the sky<br>Like majestic monuments of domination<br>The symbol<br>A land conquered <br>Nature controlled <br>All the pretty peoples in their right place<br>Re-write history to save face<br>An indigenous nightmare <br>Children crying for their families absolved<br>Thrown away to places deemed worthless <br>God help these poor souls<br>The “misguided heathens” must learn of true salvation through violence <br>Just the way Jesus wanted<br>An organized justification for injustice <br>The sins of the masters begin to surface <br>Scarifications of generations <br>Wealth denied <br>Beaten and bruised<br>Man as animal <br>Enacting violence to control<br>All is commodity<br>Products to own<br>Both real and imagined <br>Death is the price of the non-subservient <br>A silence to mock the truth<br>A convenient gospel to cover the atrocities<br>All wrapped up in pretty white sheets<br>Like the ghosts of violence past<br>Wizards of hatred spewing distortions<br>Darkening the Earth with their strange fruits<br>Animosity towards reality <br>Bury the truth or it may set you free<br>Boxed up and shut out<br>Shipped off and shut off<br>Out of sight and out of mind<br>Assimilation of all deemed inferior <br>Language as a weapon for perception<br>Good vs evil<br>Us vs them<br>This lexicon of control is now digitally interfaced <br>Uncivilized man thrown into a cage<br>As the truly civilized are thrown into a rage<br>Calm down little sage<br>“God does not want you to to rock the boat”<br>Says the man who created these writings<br>Divine wisdom carefully filtered <br>The essence extracted to create an intoxicant <br>An opiate for the masses <br>These Apes with nuclear weapons <br>Drunk on ego <br>Fighting against intellectual progress <br>The good pushed into the corner <br>Exiled like a dunce who hangs out with baby<br>Directions unseen <br>For the corrections unseen<br>The error of man still guiding his path <br>The tragedy of ignorance <br>Violence and “control”<br>The acts of men who cannot own up to their own actions<br>War<br>What is it good for?<br>Control</pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original poem by David Kausek</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Magical realism', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1226-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-24 20:22:13', '2026-07-25 00:22:13', '', 1226, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1231', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
