ses <br>These Apes with nuclear weapons <br>Drunk on ego <br>Fighting against intellectual progress <br>The good pushed into the corner <br>Exiled like a dunce who hangs out with baby<br>Directions unseen <br>For the corrections unseen<br>The error of man still guiding his path <br>The tragedy of ignorance <br>Violence and “control”<br>The acts of men who cannot own up to their own actions<br>War<br>What is it good for?<br>Control</pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original poem by David Kausek</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Magical realism', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1226-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-24 20:23:17', '2026-07-25 00:23:17', '', 1226, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1233', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
