(1267, 2, '2026-07-24 21:21:34', '2026-07-25 01:21:34', '<!-- wp:verse -->\n<pre class="wp-block-verse"><br><br>The mind attempts to focus<br>The world becomes blurred<br><br>Like a truth obscured <br>A reality impossible to ascertain <br><br>A silent space opens within the meditation chamber <br><br>Like a vortex encircling a living statue<br>The mind pierces this veil of illusion <br><br>All finite dimensions merge into an infinite construct<br>The observances of energy traveling through the body<br><br>Information in the form of light<br>Traveling within the vast voids between molecular structures <br><br>From this lens,<br>The body appears to be a gigantic universe <br><br>Fear is reduced to a primal reaction <br>The mystery is beyond trepidation <br><br>All infinity contained within finite space<br>Like the concept of dividing a meter into an infinite number of fragments<br>The numeric division becomes a pure concept that can no longer be replicated in the world of matter<br>It becomes a pure abstraction<br><br>A metaphysical cowboy riding the bull of reason<br>Trying hard to hold on to his small reality<br><br>Death destroys the monument of self <br><br>The ego is dissolved<br><br>The mind enters an ancient portal <br><br>The entire cosmos is awakened <br><br>The center is not the center<br>It is merely a reference point to reassemble infinite possibilities within a circle of awareness <br><br>Time and space are illusions<br>The world is Maya<br>That which is not bound by time exists outside of time<br><br>It passes through time but remains untouched <br>A rendezvous with atman<br></pre>\n<!-- /wp:verse -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"3em"} -->\n<div style="height:3em" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"right"}}} -->\n<p class="has-text-align-right">Original poem by David Kausek March 6th, 2022</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Spinning Through An Ancient Void:', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1263-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-24 21:21:34', '2026-07-25 01:21:34', '', 1263, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1267', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
<br>Explore my packages.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {"style":{"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"1em"}}},"layout":{"type":"flex","justifyContent":"center"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-buttons" style="padding-top:1em"><!-- wp:button {"className":"animated fadeIn slow is-style-fill","style":{"border":{"width":"2px","radius":{"topLeft":"32px","topRight":"32px","bottomLeft":"32px","bottomRight":"32px"}},"spacing":{"padding":{"left":"24px","right":"24px","top":"10px","bottom":"10px"}},"typography":{"fontSize":"1.15em"}}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-button animated fadeIn slow is-style-fill"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-custom-font-size wp-element-button" href="https://davidkausek.com/photo-packages/" style="border-width:2px;border-top-left-radius:32px;border-top-right-radius:32px;border-bottom-left-radius:32px;border-bottom-right-radius:32px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:24px;font-size:1.15em">View packages</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {"slug":"footer","theme":"davidk-theme","area":"footer"} /-->', 'Full Width Pages', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '478-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-26 12:04:47', '2026-07-26 16:04:47', '', 478, 'https://davidkausek.com/?p=1294', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
